# Kerala Rage Solidarity: Content & Asset Integration Draft

**Document ID:** CONTENT-001-SOLIDARITY
**Status:** Unified Design Draft
**Dependencies:** `docs/design/06-wireframes.md`, `kerala-rage-design-principles.md`

---

## Executive Summary

This document provides the "Solidarity Press" copy and precise asset placement instructions for the pages identified as having **Critical Design Gaps**. It orchestrates the "Solidarity Typography Strategy" (Bebas Neue / Sora / Space Grotesk) alongside the Street Art / Screenprint assets to ensure a cohesive, defiant implementation.

---

## Page 1: Landing ("The Solidarity Manifesto")

**Primary Assets:**

- `{kr-asset-halo-disk}` (The Focal Anchor)
- `{kr-asset-wheat-paste-tear}` (The Urban Edge)
- `{kr-asset-screenprint-grit}` (Tactile Atmosphere)

### Copy & Typography Strategy

| Element           | Draft Copy                                                            | Typography Token                                          |
| :---------------- | :-------------------------------------------------------------------- | :-------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Hero Headline** | THE SOLIDARITY<br>MANIFESTO                                           | **Font:** Bebas Neue<br>**Color:** `baruGold`             |
| **Subhead**       | _Your professional history, re-documented for the collective future._ | **Font:** Sora Variable<br>**Color:** `paper-white` (80%) |
| **CTA Primary**   | BUILD YOUR STORY                                                      | **Font:** Bebas Neue<br>**Style:** Button                 |
| **CTA Secondary** | VIEW THE COLLECTIVE                                                   | **Font:** Plus Jakarta Sans<br>**Weight:** 400            |

### Asset Integration Guide

- **{kr-asset-halo-disk}**: Positioned behind the "The Solidarity Manifesto" headline as a radiating aura in `baruGold`. Opacity: 40%.
- **{kr-asset-wheat-paste-tear}**: Applied as a `clip-path` and decorative overlay to the bottom of the hero section, suggesting a posters ripped from a wall.
- **{kr-asset-screenprint-grit}**: Global overlay at 5% opacity to break the "clean digital" look.

